1. Copy these files into your project folder (replace script.js, package.json; keep index.html + style.css).
2. In index.html, add under the style.css link:  <link rel="stylesheet" href="enhance.css">
3. npm install
4. npm run dev   -> site on http://localhost:5173, API + SQLite on :3000
